{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112748","id":3009193669,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6zXKbF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112748","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112748.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112748.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112748","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112748/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112748/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112748/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/887db1d03c9f0629b3ecdf2822d1df1296ea0b31","number":112748,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Duplicate Resources Separate from each other when using selecting multiple Nodes","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13163\r\n\r\n## Multi-Node Fixes\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n![MultiBefore](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3a8f21d-f81f-47c5-bd1d-b97709e1aec8)\r\n\r\n### After\r\n![MultiAfter](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae7c2ad0-1e43-48be-b3a4-ebef501a95ab)\r\n\r\n- Every Resource from a selection will be duplicated and assigned to its respective node. This ensures the same behavior as selecting each Node one by one and making its Resource unique.\r\n- For `Make_Unique (Recursive)`, it triggers an Error message if you uncheck a Parent Resource but tries to duplicate its Subresources. This is because duplication has no effect in these cases (i.e, SubResources are still linked).  This is fine when only one Node is selected, but it crashes for Dictionaries, so that's why it must be addressed in this PR.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien